id: SECRETS-015
title: CircleCI API Token
category: secrets
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .tsx .js .jsx .py .java .go .rb .rs .cpp .h .cs .php .env .yml .yaml .json .toml .xml .properties .cfg .ini .conf .sh .tf .hcl
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/ __pycache__/ .venv/ target/
patterns:
  - regex: circle-ci_[a-f0-9]{40}
    message: CircleCI API token detected. This grants access to CircleCI projects and build configurations.
  - regex: circleci_[a-zA-Z0-9]{40}
    message: CircleCI API token detected. This grants access to CircleCI projects and build configurations.
fix: Revoke the token at CircleCI > User Settings > Personal API Tokens. Regenerate and store in CircleCI environment variables.
